Every file carries an SPDX header naming that holder. Sole ownership is what
makes the dual licence in LICENSING.md possible: only the holder of all rights
can offer the same code under a commercial arm.

External code contributions are not accepted before 1.0. After that they are
accepted only under the contributor agreement in CONTRIBUTING.md, which assigns
the same rights to the holder above. Issues, test captures and interoperability
reports are welcome at any time and are not code contributions.
